WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:25.000
We were part of a home, sometimes part of a time.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
I'm so proud hiding you, your worth based on my life.

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
I'll watch you shape your world, standing right where you are.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
Sometimes I can't but think, if the things I've done could be right.

00:42.000 --> 01:01.000
Trying so hard not to care, then all I want's all to break.

01:01.000 --> 01:06.000
I know I had to let go, but there's still hearts inside.

01:06.000 --> 01:11.000
And no one here to still blame, just two roads go apart.

01:11.000 --> 01:15.000
So things stay in the heart, and then we will be reborn.

01:15.000 --> 01:23.000
Sometimes I can't but think, if the things could have turned out right.

01:23.000 --> 01:43.000
Trying so hard not to care, then all I want's all to break.

01:43.000 --> 01:48.000
I don't know where you are, but I wish you the best.

01:48.000 --> 01:52.000
Wherever you may be, I hope you find happiness.

01:52.000 --> 02:20.000
I got me wet with weather, and then we meet again.

02:20.000 --> 02:40.000
Trying so hard not to care, then all I want's all to break.

02:50.000 --> 02:55.000
Thanks for watching!

